BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://iondistrict.com/wp
 -content/uploads/2024/07/CoJ1.jpg?ver=1721850637
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/0
 7/CoJ1.jpg?ver=1721850637
UID:3J9Upk88iJpqSVP7rIWmV
SUMMARY:Ion Networking with Cup of Joey
DTSTAMP:20260724T105729Z
DTSTART:20260724T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:What is the purpose of Cup of Joey? It is to create a connected
	 culture of coffee shop-open networking across our region. Every Friday mo
	rning\, you’ll have the opportunity to meet new and expand your current ne
	tworks\, talk about tech\, inspire innovation\, and create community. \nSo
	\, what is the difference between a cup of joe and a Cup of Joe-Y? It is t
	he WHY. It’s not what you do. It is why you do it! \nAt the Ion\, these ar
	e questions that we want to explore with the tech and innovation community
	. So\, show up\, be friendly\, and make new connections. Know your why\, a
	nd we will get to the future together. \nThe future is only a cup away. \n
	Register Here: https://www.cupofjoey.org/\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event
	/ion-networking-with-cup-of-joey-34/2026-07-24/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/ion-networking-with-cup-of-joey-34/2026-0
	7-24/
LOCATION:Ion – Lobby\, 4201 Main St.\, Houston\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/01/%E2%AD%95%EF%B8%8FCYBERSECURITY-CIRCLE%E2%AD%95%EF
 %B8%8F.png?ver=1767643977
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01
 /%E2%AD%95%EF%B8%8FCYBERSECURITY-CIRCLE%E2%AD%95%EF%B8%8F.png?ver=17676439
 77
UID:kDh2q2n0O31RX1hV_kLat
SUMMARY:⭕️Cybersecurity Circle⭕️
DTSTAMP:20260724T105729Z
DTSTART:20260724T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Our mission is to DEFEAT CYBER CRIMINALS by making cybersecurit
	y knowledge accessible and relatable to everyone. This event creates a sup
	portive environment for individuals starting their cybersecurity journey\,
	 those transitioning into the field\, and professionals navigating job tra
	nsitions—including those rebuilding confidence after layoffs. Together\, w
	e strengthen our collective defense against cyber threats while fostering 
	career growth and community connections.\nThe ⭕️Cybersecurity Circle⭕️ unite
	s practitioners of all levels in an inclusive community committed to defea
	ting cybercrime through shared knowledge\, collaboration\, and continuous 
