	to their mission: Volunteers helping\, teaching youngsters the power of th
	e pen? and then donors rewarding their efforts\, by translating their wish
	es into reality\, not only positively reinforces their nascent literacy sk
	ills\, but it also helps participants author a different\, more positive n
	arrative about life\, one sparked by optimism and the vision of a brighter
	 future. santaforaday.org\n\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/friko-something-
